[l_english.MODULE_ENGINE_3C_NECRO]
Necromancy Engine

[l_english.MODULE_ENGINE_3C_NECRO_desc]
Pony-driven tanks use living ponies as their power source. If they die, you can use the Necromancy Engine now.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_ENGINE_3C_NECRO]
厄灵引擎

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_ENGINE_3C_NECRO_desc]
马力驱动的坦克让活着的小马成为坦克的动力，如果他们死了，那你就可以用厄灵引擎了。
